00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:39.510
Kii-chan has her own private lab in DreAca,

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:43.640
and she spends most of her time there, not even going back to her own room.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:46.640
And you talk to the computers as if they were your friends, right?

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.140
How do you know that?

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:52.130
Well, you see, we snuck into DreAca and...

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.150
It's because Aoi's an idol professor.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:58.650
Well, even if people know, it's ok-ok-okay!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.010
Really?

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.660
Then is Mister S going after Seira?

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:06.080
You dragged her here to hide, right?

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:08.210
That's the Beautiful Blade for you.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:09.910
Cutting straight to the truth.

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:14.590
Yes, the reason Mister S has been snooping around DreAca

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:18.300
must be because he's going after the new rising star, Seira!

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.840
But why did you come to Starlight Academy?

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.410
To hide a tree, you put it in a forest.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.810
To hide an idol, you put her with more idols. {did she always have a cane?}

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.290
Right, right, right?

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.480
This is the best place to hide Seira.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:35.300
I don't have any secrets.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:35.940
