00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:37.470
No!

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:39.430
I'm your producer.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:41.610
I'm going to protect you from scandals! {"the" scandals?}

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:42.680
Kii...

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:47.550
You're an idol now, too.

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.510
