00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:09.650
I became an idol, but I'm still your producer!

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:13.480
I can chase after two rabbits and catch them both!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.820
Kii...

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:24.820
Sorry.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.200
It's fine.

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:29.700
By the way...

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.080
What's Seira-chan's scandalous secret?

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:34.930
I want to know!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:38.020
Hey, this makes us no better than Mister S.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.880
