00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:44.760
I can't tell our rivals at Starlight Academy stuff like that! {or "know stuff"}

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.680
If you found out that Seira the rock star had a cute side to her...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.390
A-A cute side?

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.180
Tell us more!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.940
This is juicy beyond belief!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.810
I promise I won't tell anyone!

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:55.850
No way.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.290
Meow. Meow meow?

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:02.860
Meow meow meow! {I feel so silly}

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.120
Meow meow. Meow?

