00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:11.480
No!

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:17.620
There's no way Seira the rock star could like kitties this much and even talk to them!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.040
I see.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.750
Seira-chan likes cats.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:23.960
Oops!

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.210
She can even speak with them.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:28.110
The idol who can speak to cats.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:29.090
That's something new.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.750
It's not like I'm actually talking to them,

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.650
but I feel like our feelings can be communicated. {just use song}

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:37.600
This isn't something I wanted to hide.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:40.400
I don't mind people knowing at all.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.110
Is Seira-chan not allowed to like cats or something?

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.830
It's just that Seira's a cool rock star

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:50.860
and going "meow meow" to a kitty is a really cute thing to do.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.490
Her image would fall apart.

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.290
You think so?

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:57.120
I think people would like Seira-chan even more. {-chan!}

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.250
Fans want to know every side of their favorite idols.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:04.420
Does Mister S already know about this?

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:08.580
I don't know for sure, but he was definitely snooping around DreAca,

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.680
so he might know.

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:14.640
Kii-chan, come with me!

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.140
Where are we going? {.....???}

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.600
Let's have a strategy session!

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:23.250
If Mister S found out about the cat thing...

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:25.520
In that case...

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:28.680
I know, right? I just had an idea!

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:31.450
All we have to do is get it out before he does!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:32.390
Yeah!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.580
You want to tell everyone about Seira's cat-liking side

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:42.830
before Mister S can spin it into something bad?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.120
Yes.

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:46.020
Kii-chan, are you sure?

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:49.630
As Seira's producer, I think this is the best course of action.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:53.540
Got it. If you say so, then let's do it.

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:57.850
I think this could end up being a net positive for Seira.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.220
Headmistress...

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.000
Also, Kii-chan,

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.850
make sure you give it your best as an idol in your fashion show!

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.090
I will! {running out of fuel}

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.750
<i>What Mister S is after isn't Seira.</i>

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.870
<i>His true target is...</i>

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.450
Kii, go for it.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.210
Okay!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:28.500
Aoi, we bought it for you.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.760
Today's issue of <i>Idol Freak Daily</i>.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:33.050
Thanks.

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:35.650
Oh, there it is.

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:37.060
The article on Seira-chan.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:41.160
"The Rock Idol Otoshiro Seira-chan's True Face".

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.430
Yeah, this is great.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.550
The fans are going to like it.

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:49.090
The cool, cute, and cat-speaking Seira-chan!

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:49.920
I like it!

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:53.860
Was this really the scandal Mister S was digging up?

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:56.170
I don't know,

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:01.270
but so far, there haven't been any other articles that are scandalous at all.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:04.920
I wonder what the scandal Mister S was digging up was.

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:07.390
What's this about a scandal?

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.260
Headmistress!

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.920
It's about Mister S.

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:15.630
He wasn't going after Otoshiro Seira, right?

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.890
So what <i>was</i> he after?

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:22.310
Well, all I know is that it's not 
anything about our love lives.

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.770
Love lives?

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.520
Are you girls embroiled in some sort of romance?

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:26.440
No...

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:27.560
Not yet.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.940
But it'd be nice eventually.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.280
I see.

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:35.240
This is a good chance for me to tell you.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.160
These are my thoughts on idols and love.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.160
Okay.

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:42.550
I believe that idols should have the right to love.

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:44.910
It's not something that's inherently bad.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:51.190
But it's also true that you will be disappointing some of the fans who have been supporting you.

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:55.390
So when you do find love, make sure not to do it half-heartedly.

00:17:55.390 --> 00:18:00.140
There's no rule against engaging in romance at Starlight Academy.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:06.020
When you do fall in love one day, please don't hide it from me.

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:08.830
Earnest love.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.470
Sincere love.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:13.070
Love that outshines even the sun.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:17.780
Remember, the most important thing is that you're happy.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:24.660
As long as you appear happy, there will be fans cheering you on.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.710
I'll always be cheering you on as well.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:27.930
So you will... {I don't even...}

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:35.340
I'm so glad to have Aoi, Ran, you, Dad, Mom, and even Raichi supporting me.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:40.840
A love that makes family, friends, teachers, and even fans support us...

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:43.060
That's what we should aim for.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:44.810
Exactly.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.810
All three of you, if you're going to love, make it wonderful. {sounds wrong, but she's not saying they have to love, but in the mayby possibly one in a million chance of it, make it suteki}

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:48.940
Okay!

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.570
I read the article about Seira-chan.

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:54.850
Yeah!

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:57.190
Everything turned out ok-ok-okay!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.200
Thanks for inviting me to that strategy session.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:02.190
You're welcome.

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:04.660
Today's another day of idol activities!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:07.200
Let's knock this first-love fashion show out!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.710
Yeah!

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:15.500
Dream Academy...

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.560
There must be a reason behind its sudden ascent in the past year...

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:23.900
Someday I will reveal the secret behind your success.

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:57.790
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:01.550
I'm glad we told everyone about Seira's secret! {said everything/revealed}

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:04.870
When you hide something, people try really hard to find it out.

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:07.420
Image building is hard.

00:24:08.110 --> 00:24:09.920
Keep secrets in moderation.

00:24:10.770 --> 00:24:13.820
I'm going to be wearing a Constellation Dress too. {finally back to seiza dresses}

00:24:13.820 --> 00:24:14.660
Congratulations!

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:18.120
As long as I have this, I know I'll be able to perform a Constellation Appeal.

00:24:18.120 --> 00:24:19.460
Right, Eriphon? {what}{I hear ebihon, but we'll now for sure next ep with the CCs}

00:24:19.460 --> 00:24:20.890
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.890 --> 00:24:22.050
Mascot Cha-Ran-way!

00:24:22.050 --> 00:24:25.720
Always passionate, idol activities!
